      "writtenOn": "2022-06-17T17:54:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m worried about `CONFIG_PRINTF_LEGACY_LI_FORMAT` and this update being so similar. maybe it\u0027s worth just wrapping the two together but then I worry about unintended consequences on other devices. Thoughts?",
      "revId": "ff4a3a5db35036159ee8d3d563aa7fe21e477a0b",
