      "writtenOn": "2022-06-17T19:01:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Interesting!\n\nI looked at the list of devices where this is used and I see only FPMCU and nucleo boards:\n\n\n```\nbaseboard/nucleo-h743zi/base-board.h\n95:#define CONFIG_PRINTF_LEGACY_LI_FORMAT\n\nbaseboard/nucleo-f412zg/base-board.h\n167:#define CONFIG_PRINTF_LEGACY_LI_FORMAT\n\nbuild/bloonchipper/.config\n176:CONFIG_PRINTF_LEGACY_LI_FORMAT\u003dy\n\ninclude/printf.h\n54: *   - \u0027i\u0027 - signed integer if CONFIG_PRINTF_LEGACY_LI_FORMAT is set (ignore l)\n\ninclude/config.h\n3622:#undef CONFIG_PRINTF_LEGACY_LI_FORMAT\n\nboard/hatch_fp/board.h\n233:#define CONFIG_PRINTF_LEGACY_LI_FORMAT\n\nboard/nocturne_fp/board.h\n109:#define CONFIG_PRINTF_LEGACY_LI_FORMAT\n\ncommon/printf.c\n342:#ifdef CONFIG_PRINTF_LEGACY_LI_FORMAT\n347:#endif /* CONFIG_PRINTF_LEGACY_LI_FORMAT */\n\nutil/config_allowed.txt\n720:CONFIG_PRINTF_LEGACY_LI_FORMAT\n```\n\nIf we squashed the two flags we would need to rename the existing one, right?",
      "parentUuid": "40eb79b1_9a30feb2",
      "revId": "ff4a3a5db35036159ee8d3d563aa7fe21e477a0b",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
